      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://wikishire.co.uk/wiki/Hulme"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 16th‑century Hulme Hall, now a private home, showcases the area’s Tudor architecture and long‑standing manor heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
