      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hulme"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2007, the “Temple 2000” sculpture by George Wyllie was unveiled in Hulme Park, celebrating the site of the former Royce factory.",
